{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01350",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 6.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Doctor? Hello, I hope this is the right time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.96,
      "end_seconds": 13.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "So, not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.61,
      "end_seconds": 23.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "Okay, so honestly, it's burning when I pass urine, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.91,
      "end_seconds": 26.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.99,
      "end_seconds": 43.91,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "Erm, you know, it's been going on for five days. I've also been going to the toilet often, for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.12,
      "end_seconds": 48.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Okay, how much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.04,
      "end_seconds": 53.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "About a four out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.2,
      "end_seconds": 58.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Any a dull ache low in your tummy as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.59,
      "end_seconds": 70.97,
      "duration_seconds": 11.38,
      "text": "I mean, yes, about the same, about two weeks. With dull ache low in my tummy, honestly, a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.11,
      "end_seconds": 78.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "Have you had burning when you pass urine before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.81,
      "end_seconds": 89.87,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "Yes, you know, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.91,
      "end_seconds": 93.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.85,
      "end_seconds": 108.3,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "I had my septum straightened in my thirties. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.0,
      "end_seconds": 111.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.72,
      "end_seconds": 118.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "I have thin bones. I've had an irregular heartbeat, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.22,
      "end_seconds": 125.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Okay, I can see thin bones in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.72,
      "end_seconds": 143.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Alright, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.31,
      "end_seconds": 163.91,
      "duration_seconds": 15.6,
      "text": "Apixaban, 5 milligrams, twice a day for the heart rhythm. Though honestly, uh, some days I forget to take it. Before this I was on alendronate; that's been stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.12,
      "end_seconds": 167.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.81,
      "end_seconds": 182.44,
      "duration_seconds": 12.63,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. My husband and I live above the shop. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.95,
      "end_seconds": 198.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "A few quick ones: fever, blood in the urine or vaginal discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.75,
      "end_seconds": 204.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.9,
      "end_seconds": 207.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "How about back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.34,
      "end_seconds": 212.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "No, you know, no back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.54,
      "end_seconds": 215.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.04,
      "end_seconds": 220.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.58,
      "end_seconds": 225.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.9,
      "end_seconds": 239.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.96,
      "end_seconds": 266.94,
      "duration_seconds": 11.98,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 70 beats a minute, respiratory rate 15, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, blood pressure 111 over 68, temp 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.41,
      "end_seconds": 270.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.85,
      "end_seconds": 274.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.05,
      "end_seconds": 279.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.27,
      "end_seconds": 283.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.32,
      "end_seconds": 304.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with slight tenderness just above the pubic bone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.84,
      "end_seconds": 309.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.49,
      "end_seconds": 335.02,
      "duration_seconds": 10.53,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: I don't have a clear answer today: an uncomplicated urinary infection is possible, and so is vaginal irritation."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.62,
      "end_seconds": 339.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.36,
      "end_seconds": 353.36,
      "duration_seconds": 13.0,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an uncomplicated urinary infection, but I'd like to confirm. I'd like to arrange a urine dipstick for burning urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 354.9,
      "end_seconds": 357.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "The earliest is Wednesday, 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.84,
      "end_seconds": 381.06,
      "duration_seconds": 21.22,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, three days. That's for urinary infection. Drink plenty of water and avoid holding urine. We'll catch up if it is not better in three days. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.92,
      "end_seconds": 396.47,
      "duration_seconds": 14.55,
      "text": "So, I take the nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day and come back if it is not better in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.0,
      "end_seconds": 403.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.85,
      "end_seconds": 407.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.95,
      "end_seconds": 410.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}